@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #2C7A6B
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F7F8FA
skinparam stateBorderColor #2C7A6B
title 账号会话 · 状态图

[*] --> NoSession : 启动 / 无本地会话
state "未登录\nNoSession" as NoSession
state "登录中\nAuthenticating" as Authing
state "已登录\nAuthenticated" as Authed
state "会话过期\nExpired" as Expired
state "退出中\nLoggingOut" as LoggingOut

NoSession --> Authing : 提交登录
NoSession --> Authing : 注册成功后进入登录
Authing --> Authed : 登录成功\n保存 token / expiresAt / user
Authing --> NoSession : 登录失败\n保留输入并提示
Authed --> Expired : 401 / expiresAt 到达
Expired --> Authing : 重新登录
Expired --> NoSession : 用户取消
Authed --> LoggingOut : 用户退出
LoggingOut --> NoSession : 本地会话已清除
Authed --> Authing : 切换账号\n清除挑战/收藏/页面缓存
Authed --> Authed : 刷新 CurrentUser

note right of Authed
  entry: 加载 CurrentUser
  exit: 清 SessionStore + 业务缓存
end note

note bottom of Authing
  登录中禁用提交按钮；
  但会话是否有效仍以服务端为准。
end note

@enduml
